      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101700101/1017001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、さっきのダンスって、\r\nモニターで流れてたCMのやつだよね？　練習してたの？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001010050,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "ううん、ちょっとやってみただけっすよ\r\n見てたら楽しそうだったんで！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700101/1017001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？　それってつまり……\r\nその場で見て、マネしてみたってことなのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001010060,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "はいっす！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700101/1017001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……簡単に言ってのけたけど、\r\nこの子、すごいことをしている自覚はないのか……）",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（もしかしたら……とんでもない才能を持ってるのかも）",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001010070,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "～♪",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700101/1017001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "実は俺、こういうものなんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
